UID:a0b9b407-b0ba-5f9b-98d3-ae5448fc3fca
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251027T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251027T140000
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to invite you to the Healthcare Career Readiness
  Summit: Careers That Care – Entry Points into Healthcare\, acollaborati
 ve convening designed to strengthen the pipeline from high school to healt
 hcare careers in WNC.Why Attend?This summit will provide valuable insights
  for school counselors\, CTE directors\, and educators supporting students
  who are exploringhealthcare career pathways. Participants will:• Learn 
 about health science pathways in WNC community colleges and universities.
 • Hear directly from healthcare employers about workforce needs.• Expl
 ore admissions and financial aid options to support students.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Health Summit - Asheville MAHEC Education Center 
END:VEVENT
